    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dr. Matthew Fountain, a dentist from Blue Lake, bought 200 acres on the Trinity River and built the first bridge linking both sides.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://enjoymagazine.com/2023/04/steeped-in-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "That bridge made Salyer a stagecoach stop for miners, later replaced by a cement crossing by the county.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
